  "body_html": "<article class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-12 @md:gap-16 mt-10\"><div class=\"@container w-full max-w-container @md:shaded-container:px-0!\"><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"--hero-aspect-ratio:16/9;--hero-aspect-ratio-mobile:3/4\"><div class=\"@container w-full multi-columns:px-0 @md:shaded-container:px-0! toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\" data-section-header=\"true\"><div class=\"col-span-full col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-10 @md:col-start-2 @lg:col-span-8 @lg:col-start-3\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"meta\"><p class=\"text-meta text-primary-100\">November 13, 2026</p><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-meta text-primary-60 hover:text-primary-100\" href=\"/news/product-releases/\">Product</a></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"text-h1 toc-collision-target max-w-250 text-primary-100 text-balance scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"headline\">Introducing ChatGPT Wallet</h1></div><div class=\"toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] mt-6 w-full\"><p class=\"col-span-full toc-collision-target text-primary-100 col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3 justify-self-center text-balance\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"subhead\">Building trusted agentic payments with networks, banks, and businesses.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-0 toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] mt-12 @md:mt-16\" data-article-hero-media=\"true\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-collision-target col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-10 @md:col-start-2\"><div class=\"col-span-full overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"w-full mx-auto transition-opacity duration-medium ease-curve-c max-w-container-desktop relative min-h-0\"><div class=\"relative min-h-0 w-full\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9\"><div class=\"@container w-full\"><div class=\"relative w-full toc-collision-target rounded-md bg-background\" data-video-container=\"true\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9\"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"\"></template><!--/$--></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\"><div class=\"@container col-span-full w-full min-w-0 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-3\" data-show-toc=\"true\"><div class=\"toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] @md:w-full article-actions-spacing pt-20 w-full\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 flex w-full flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-3 border-t border-t-primary-4 pt-3\" data-article-hero-actions=\"true\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"support\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 ms-auto\"><div class=\"relative\"><div aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" data-state=\"closed\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-cta\"><button class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3em] text-cta focus:outline outline-offset-2 h-[2.5rem] text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 disabled:text-primary-44 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-primary-44 px-0 !rounded\" type=\"button\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"17\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.52 7.62a.875.875 0 0 1 1.244 1.232L4.67 9.957l-.003.003c-1.384 1.385-1.421 3.658.147 5.227 1.568 1.568 3.842 1.531 5.227.147l.002-.002 1.107-1.095a.875.875 0 0 1 1.231 1.243l-1.106 1.096c-2.105 2.1-5.485 2.062-7.698-.152s-2.251-5.592-.15-7.697z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M11.881 6.881A.876.876 0 0 1 13.12 8.12l-5 5a.876.876 0 0 1-1.24-1.24z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M8.726 3.425c2.105-2.1 5.485-2.063 7.698.15s2.252 5.594.15 7.699L15.48 12.38a.875.875 0 0 1-1.244-1.231l1.095-1.107.003-.002c1.384-1.385 1.421-3.659-.147-5.227s-3.842-1.53-5.227-.147l-.003.003-1.106 1.095a.876.876 0 0 1-1.23-1.244z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path></svg>Share</button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col col-span-full min-w-0 md:row-start-1\" data-toc-content=\"\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>We’re introducing ChatGPT Wallet, setting a new bar for secure payments by agents. It’s the first wallet that lets agents pay without access to users’ actual card details and that requires a security check for every purchase, while also preserving existing card rewards and protections for eligible disputes. Built in partnership with American Express, Mastercard, and Visa, ChatGPT Wallet will initially be available through </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-dots/\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>dots</span></u>⁠</a><span> for ChatGPT Pro subscribers in the US. Alongside ChatGPT Wallet, we’re releasing tools and guidance to help businesses support customers using agents.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>1.2B people use ChatGPT each week, and many of them turn to it to research products, compare options, and decide what to buy. With ChatGPT Wallet, we’re now helping people complete purchases, and giving their agents a way to pay that businesses can accept with their existing systems.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>To accept payment from ChatGPT Wallet, websites need to ensure agents are not inadvertently blocked, and payment and risk systems need to recognize legitimate purchases made by agents. We’re starting with limited availability to ChatGPT Pro users, so we can learn from real-world use and work with businesses, banks, and payment networks to improve compatibility and reliability.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"how-a-purchase-works\"><div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>How a purchase works</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>ChatGPT Wallet gives agents a secure way to pay on a user’s behalf. Users add a card once, then approve each purchase without re-entering their payment details.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Before each purchase, the user reviews the items, total, and selected card, then approves it with a security check such as Face ID or a fingerprint scan. Each approval creates a clear record of the purchase the user authorized the agent to make.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>After the user approves, the payment network provides a payment token—a substitute for the user’s actual card details—with a card number, security code, and expiration date. The payment is charged to their selected card without ChatGPT Wallet sharing their actual card details with the business or agent.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>We’re building agent-led commerce to fit reliably into existing systems. Users keep their card’s existing rewards and protections for eligible disputes with businesses, for example when an item is defective. Banks and networks bring their expertise to evaluating transactions. Users transact directly with businesses, which keep their customer relationships and control over pricing, fulfillment, returns, and customer service.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Over time, we expect users to be able to delegate purchases entirely to their agent by setting clear parameters—such as spending limits, purchase categories, or time periods—and pre-approve those purchases with enhanced safeguards that build on today’s protections, including biometric checks and clear records of authorization.</span></p></div><div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\"><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-carousel-view\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex justify-end\"><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-controls\"><span class=\"text-meta text-primary-60\">1 of 3</span><div class=\"flex\"><button aria-label=\"Previous testimonial\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 focus:outline-primary-44 text-btn-media-label\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><use height=\"16\" href=\"/icons/cms/a7687e3ce5db398c/arrow-left-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\"></use></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Next testimonial\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 text-primary-60 hover:bg-primary-4 hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 focus:outline-primary-44 -ms-1 active:scale-95\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><use height=\"16\" href=\"/icons/cms/a7687e3ce5db398c/arrow-right-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)] px-6 py-8\"><div class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-contain\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-scroll-region\"><div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 grid w-full\"><figure aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>Working with OpenAI, we’re bringing the trust, security and control of American Express payments into new AI-powered shopping experiences. ChatGPT Wallet marks our first American Express Agentic Commerce Experiences integration, enabling eligible Card Members to use their Amex Card while reviewing and approving each purchase. We’re excited to learn together from this early phase and build toward bringing these experiences to more Card Members over time.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><span>—</span><b><span>Luke Gebb</span></b><span>, EVP and Head of Global Innovation, American Express</span></figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\" inert=\"\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>An agent making a purchase should strengthen, not bypass, the trust built into payments. Our collaboration with OpenAI brings Mastercard’s payments and security expertise to ChatGPT Wallet, helping connect user-approved purchases with the systems businesses and banks already use. Working together across the industry is how we turn the promise of agentic commerce into experiences people and businesses can trust.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><span>—</span><b><span>Sherri Haymond</span></b><span>, EVP, Global Head of Digital Commercialization, Mastercard</span></figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\" inert=\"\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>To deliver on the promise of agentic commerce, consumers, businesses and banks all need to trust the process. We’re partnering with OpenAI to bring Visa’s trusted infrastructure to the experience, helping connect user-approved purchases with the systems businesses already use.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><span>—</span><b><span>Rubail Birwadker</span></b><span>, Head of Global Growth, Visa</span></figcaption></figure></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-0 w-full\"><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div></div></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 -translate-inline-1/2 pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[-0.4rem] z-1 hidden size-3 rotate-45 rounded-xs border-e border-b md:block\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-tail\" style=\"inset-inline-start:16.666666666666664%\"></span></div><div class=\"relative mt-3 overflow-hidden\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-1 hidden md:block\"><ul class=\"flex\" style=\"width:100%;mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 0 0);mask-position:0% 0;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-size:33.333333333333336% 100%;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-position:0% 0;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-size:33.333333333333336% 100%\"><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">American Express</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Mastercard</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Visa</div></li></ul></div><ul aria-label=\"Testimonials\" class=\"relative flex\" style=\"width:100%\"><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><button aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from American Express\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 md:text-primary-60\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-balance\">American Express</span></button></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><button aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Mastercard\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Mastercard</span></button></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\"><button aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Visa\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Visa</span></button></li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"equipping-businesses-for-agentic-commerce\"><div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>Equipping businesses for agentic commerce</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Agentic commerce is still in its early days. As agents begin to take on more shopping and purchasing tasks, many websites and payment systems are still adapting to this modality. Some sites may unintentionally block purchases through ChatGPT Wallet or other agentic payment products, and we are focused on helping businesses make that transition.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Alongside ChatGPT Wallet, we’re publishing a </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/commerce\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>Commerce Partner Playbook</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> with tools and practical guidance to help businesses support customers using agents through their existing websites and systems. It covers making product information available, ensuring agent access, and working with payment and risk providers to reduce unnecessary declines. Businesses can start with the areas most relevant to their customers:</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><ul class=\"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4\"><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><b><span>Help customers find accurate product information. </span></b><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"/index/introducing-businesses-chatgpt/\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>Claim your business in ChatGPT</span></u></a><span> and, once verified, update your business details and upload a product feed with current pricing and availability.</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><b><span>Ensure ChatGPT agents can access your website.</span></b><span> Configure your CDN or firewall to recognize signed requests using Web Bot Auth and confirm your general site security measures are not inadvertently blocking ChatGPT agents. Browser access does not require a plugin or product feed.</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><b><span>Work with your payments and risk providers to support agent purchases. </span></b><span>Wallet’s payment tokens work with existing checkout flows, but risk systems may still flag legitimate purchases made by agents, leading to declines or cancellations. You can work with your providers to understand how they recognize these transactions. We’re also working with fraud prevention partners including Forter, Riskified, Sardine and Signifyd and payment service providers including Adyen, Checkout.com, and Stripe to help their systems recognize legitimate purchases made by agents.</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><b><span>Give agents more ways to work with your business.</span></b><span> Build a plugin to let agents check availability, manage carts, or take other actions through your existing systems. Websites can also add WebMCP tools.</span></p></li></ul></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"availability\"><div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>Availability</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>ChatGPT Wallet begins rolling out today in dots, enabling users to have their dot complete purchases on their behalf. It will initially be available to ChatGPT Pro subscribers aged 18 and older in the US with eligible US-issued cards. We’ll work with businesses, banks, and payment networks to learn from early use and expand availability, helping more customers and businesses benefit from agentic commerce.</span></p></div></div></div><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full scroll-mt-anchor-offset\" data-testid=\"citations\" id=\"citations\"><div class=\"rounded-md bg-primary-4 py-8 md:py-16 toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 px-5 @md:px-0 col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><section class=\"w-full\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><li><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block rounded-xl bg-primary-4 px-3 py-2! text-nav hover:bg-primary-12\" href=\"/news/?tags=chatgpt\">ChatGPT</a></li><li><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block rounded-xl bg-primary-4 px-3 py-2! text-nav hover:bg-primary-12\" href=\"/news/?tags=2026\">2026</a></li></ul></section><div data-testid=\"author-list\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-p2 text-primary-60\">Author</h2><div class=\"text-p2\">OpenAI</div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"@container w-full\"><div class=\"max-w-container mb-8 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><div><h2 class=\"text-h4 text-primary-100\">Keep reading</h2></div><a class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3em] text-cta focus:outline outline-offset-2 h-[2.5rem] min-h-0 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 disabled:text-primary-44 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-primary-44 px-0 !rounded\" href=\"/news/\">View all</a></div><div class=\"@lg:max-w-container flex w-auto\"><div class=\"w-full toc-collision-target no-scrollbar snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden\"><div class=\"@md:gap-6 flex min-w-4xl px-6 pe-6 @md:min-w-[unset] @md:px-8 @lg:px-0 grid flex-none grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"relative mb-8 @md:mb-0 snap-start ps-6 @md:ps-0 min-w-[calc(100%/3)] ps-0 last:me-0\"><div class=\"group relative\"><div class=\"absolute inset-s-0 top-0 w-full rounded-md bg-primary-12\" style=\"as